---
// Homepage-only sidebar: identity blurb, subscribe, social, disclaimer.
// Mirrors the classic personal-blog-sidebar pattern, filled with real info.
const linkClass = [
  "text-accent",
  "decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 hover:underline",
  "focus-visible:no-underline focus-visible:underline-offset-0",
].join(" ");
---

<aside class="lg:w-64 lg:shrink-0">
  <div class="border-border border-b pb-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Shivansh Sinha</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm">
      I spend most of my time in Kubernetes internals — figuring out why a
      controller reconciled wrong, or why a Helm chart drifted between
      versions. That's pulled me into the CNCF ecosystem (OpenEverest,
      KubeStellar, a few others), and lately toward where infra work meets AI
      agents. This site is mostly me writing things down before I forget
      them.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="border-border border-b pb-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Subscribe</h2>
    <a
      target="_blank"
      href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/")}rss.xml`}
      class:list={["mt-1 inline-block text-sm", linkClass]}
    >
      RSS Feed
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="border-border border-b pb-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Social</h2>
    <ul class="mt-1 space-y-1 text-sm">
      <li>
        GitHub:{" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/shivansh-source"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class:list={linkClass}
        >
          shivansh-source
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        LinkedIn:{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivansh-sinha-167304307/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class:list={linkClass}
        >
          shivansh-sinha
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        X:{" "}
        <a
          href="https://x.com/SSinha11233"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class:list={linkClass}
        >
          @SSinha11233
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Mail:{" "}
        <a
          href="mailto:shivansh976053@gmail.com"
          class:list={linkClass}
        >
          shivansh976053@gmail.com
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">
    This is my personal website. Views expressed here are my own and don't
    reflect those of any employer.
  </p>
</aside>
